    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n    <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"3\">Level 3 - Intermediate</span>\n    <span class=\"time\">45 min</span>\n    <span class=\"chip\">Machine-coding case study</span>\n    <span class=\"chip\">Patterns: Specification, Strategy, Decorator, Facade</span>\n  </div>\n  <h1>Car Rental (Zoomcar)</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">A booking system in miniature: cars at branches, reservations over time ranges, filters that combine, prices that change by rule, and the one bug every interviewer hunts for: two people booking the same car for the same hours. You will build it so that availability is derived, never stored, and the check-then-book step is atomic per car.</p>\n",
